  subgraph HONEST["🏆 **MF104 — SHE ALREADY SOLVED LAW 45. FOR MONEY. TWO DAYS AGO. NOBODY ROLLED IT.**"]
    HN["👁️ **HER SCREENSHOT, 14 JUL:** *Bazin · Mbakbaka (Libya)* → 🟢 **\'cost: not yet priced\'**<br/><br/>🏆 **`worldkitchen.js:152` — SHIPPED 12 JULY (MF45, the free-tier unpriced gate):**<br/>```// if a recipe is unpriced, the card SAYS \'not yet priced\' — it never quietly prints the sides```<br/>```else if(tierAllows(\'pro\')) costText = \'cost: not yet priced\';```<br/>🏆 **AND `worldkitchen.js:534`:** ```return \'not yet priced: \' + who.slice(0,6).join(\', \')```<br/>**← IT EVEN NAMES THE INGREDIENTS IT COULD NOT PRICE. IN THE UI. ALREADY.**<br/><br/>🩸🩸 **TINA ALREADY WROTE LAW 45 — SHE JUST WROTE IT IN MONEY, IN ONE ROOM, AND WALKED AWAY.**<br/>**\'WE DO NOT HAVE A PRICE\' ≠ \'THIS IS FREE.\' \'NOT LABELLED\' ≠ \'HAS MEAT.\'**<br/><br/>⚖️ **Law 35 — LIFT IT, DON\'T INVENT IT. THE PATTERN IS WRITTEN, TESTED AND LIVE. ROLL IT:**<br/>· 🥬 **THE DIET FILTER** silently HIDES 998 unlabelled recipes → **must say \'not yet labelled\'**<br/>· 💰 **THE BUDGET TOOL** silently DROPS 532 uncosted recipes → **must say \'184 Spice recipes are<br/>  not priced yet\'** *(`index.js:483` — `if(r.costPP==null) return false`)*<br/>· 🧂 **MF93-B\'s \'which ingredient could I not price\' LOG** → **already exists, in the UI, at :534**<br/>· 🍹 **BEVERAGES** *(ruled: never costed)* → must say **\'not costed\'**, not vanish<br/><br/>🩸 **AND \'WE CHOSE NOT TO COST THIS\' vs \'WE FORGOT TO COST THIS\' ARE BOTH `costPP:null`.<br/>THE APP CANNOT TELL THEM APART. IT NEEDS A FOURTH STATE — THE SAME ONE `diet:\'unknown\'`<br/>NEEDS.** ⚖️ **Law 45. ONE SHAPE. TWO FIELDS.**"]
  end

  subgraph PETFOOD["🐕 **PET FOOD — ⚖️ LAW 36 SETTLED IT. IT WAS NEVER COSTED.** *(14 Jul)*"]
    PF["👁️ **TINA:** *\'My friend was looking at pet food and said it\'s too expensive. I remember it, about a<br/>month ago, it DID have a cost. Go look for it.\'*<br/><br/>📏 **I LOOKED. ALL 621 COMMITS.** `furry.js` **HAS ZERO COST KEYS AND NEVER HAS HAD ONE.**<br/>*\'Pumpkin Crunch\' → 0 commits with a price. \'Peanut Butter\' → 0.*<br/>⚠️ **The OLD `furry.js` DID carry 181 `costPP` — but they were BEEF STROGANOFF and MUTTON<br/>POTJIEKOS. It was the PRE-SPLIT MONOLITH. Human dinners in the wrong file. Not pets.**<br/><br/>💡 **WHAT SHE IS PROBABLY REMEMBERING IS REAL — BUT IT IS `PRICE_DB`:** pet-food INGREDIENTS<br/>priced out dear, so she added cheaper ones. **THAT WORK HAPPENED. IT NEVER REACHED THE RECIPES.**<br/>⚖️ **Law 22 CUTS BOTH WAYS — her memory has beaten Claude\'s measurements THREE TIMES today.<br/>IF SHE CAN PICTURE THE SCREEN, KEEP DIGGING.**<br/><br/>✅ **EITHER WAY IT IS AN AFTERNOON:** `{n:\'Pumpkin purée\', pp:200, u:\'g\'}` — **60 of 62 furry<br/>recipes HAVE QUANTITIES. `costRecipe()` + PRICE_DB CAN PRICE THEM ALL, TODAY.** ⚖️ **Law 35.**"]
  end

  subgraph NEXT["🔜 **NEXT — IN ORDER**"]
    N1["**1. 🔧 MF63 — THE SEARCH SKIN. The biggest remaining root.**<br/>   **A ·** `braai.js:28` passes **`onclick:` instead of `oninput:`** — **ONE ARGUMENT.**<br/>      *(`sectionHeader()` already does BOTH modes. **core.js NEED NOT BE OPENED.** ⚖️ Law 35.)*<br/>   **B ·** `spice.js` has **ZERO `sectionHeader()` calls** — raw div at 7982.<br/>      🚨 **SPICE WAS NEVER MIGRATED TO v33.** Own commit.<br/>   **C ·** **the SUB-SCREEN header** — Braai›Mains · WK›Boerekos · Spice›Chutneys **all lose the<br/>      search two levels down.** Kills **MF72 + MF64**.<br/><br/>**2. 🧠 MF88 — THE INGREDIENT BRAIN.** *(One map. ⚖️ Law 6.)*<br/>   🩸 **3 of 17 hits for 'chicken' have only chicken STOCK — she asks for chicken and gets PORK CHOPS.**<br/>   🩸 **`fish` is BLIND to hake · snoek · salmon · tuna · prawns** — it matches the literal word, so it<br/>   returns **fish SAUCE.** 🎃 **THAT is why `fish·lemon·rice` gave only 2 cards.**<br/>   💰 **AND IT NOW COSTS REAL MONEY: a thin app result (<10) WAKES THE PAID CHEF.<br/>   A BLIND LEXICON IS AN API BILL.**<br/>   **A ·** the **`not:`** list *(stock · broth · cube ≠ the protein)* — **~20 words. Do it soon.**<br/>   **B ·** the **`is:`** list *(fish = hake·salmon·snoek·tuna·prawns)* — **Tina's food knowledge.** ⚖️ Law 11.<br/><br/>**3. 🔧 MF76** — 6 text inputs at 13–15px *(a tablet ZOOMS ITSELF IN under 16px)*<br/>**4. 🔧 MF71** — the black chrome. `body{background:#0f0e0c}` is a HEX, not a token. **MF66-B dies free.**<br/>**5. 🔧 MF70** — `wk_europe.js` double-encoded, 7786 sequences, 543 corrupted ingredient names.<br/>   ✅ **PRICES ARE SAFE — `priceClean()` strips it.** A **readability** bug. A decode, not a retype.<br/>**6. 🔧 MF52** — `/Images/Image header/` **DOES NOT EXIST.** A wrong path, not an encoding bug.<br/>**7. ⏸️ MF91 + MF92** *(parked above — after the sprint)*"]
  end

  subgraph OPEN["🆕 **STILL OPEN — READ, DON'T GUESS**"]
    O1["🧭 **MF65** — Braai›Mains → nav-Search → Back → **HOME**, not the room. **Might be MF40 (`NAV_KEYS`).**<br/>🧭 **MF84 — THE APOSTROPHE.** `shepherds pie` → **0 HITS.** **Nobody types the apostrophe on a phone.**<br/>🧂 **MF86 — the SPICE adapter writes `ingredients:[]` BY HAND** *(index.js ~384)*. **190 spice recipes<br/>   are NAME-ONLY.** ⛔ **NOT RULED.** 👁️ **TEST: search `coriander`. Does Garam Masala come back?**<br/>   🩸 **AND: Spice is INVISIBLE to 4 Ingredients while this stands.**<br/>💀 **MF75 — Budget's box IS wired** *(budget.js:299)*. ⚠️ **ONE FINGER: type `d`, then SCROLL.**<br/>🆕 **MF81 — 13 true duplicates.** ⛔ **May be the `versions` system. READ IT.**<br/>⚖️ **MF82** — Shepherd's Pie *(meals)* + Herderspastei *(world)*: **de-dupe across rooms, or not?**<br/>🗑️ **MF68 — delete the FUNCTION `tinzaSearch`, NEVER the file.** ☠️ **`search.js` holds `tinzaDisplayName`<br/>   (6 callers), `tinzaRoman`, `tinzaNormalize`. DELETING IT KILLS EVERY RECIPE NAME.** ⚖️ Law 22.<br/>🗑️ **MF79 — `makeable.js` + `bakes_additions.js` have no script tag. Never loaded. GO AND LOOK.**<br/>⚠️ **MF69 — `sa` → 1354 of 2083 = 65% of the app.** ⛔ **NOT RULED.**<br/>💣 **MF29 + MF33 — `Math.ceil` over-billing, ~2.5× in Bakes. BAKED GOODS MAY LOOK DEARER THAN<br/>   SHOP-BOUGHT. THAT INVERTS THE CORE PITCH.**<br/>🥬 **MF30 — dietary wiring** · **MF31 · MF32 · MF55 · MF48**<br/>✍️ **~20 Afrikaans names need an English GLOSS, not a translation. There is no English word for a<br/>   koeksister. There is a koeksister.** ⚖️ Law 11."]
